# Where the client sends API requests.
#
# Leave this unset for local development: the Vite dev server proxies /api to
# the backend, which keeps the browser on one origin. The API mounts no CORS
# middleware and its OAuth state cookie is SameSite=Lax, so a cross-origin
# client is refused twice over.
#
# Set it only when the API is genuinely served from another origin, and add
# CORS on the server before you do.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
